WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
Ana gets eight cards in order and calls “Come At Me!”

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Ben breaks her row with a free shot. Ana earns a Fix-It marker.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:11.000
The marker gives Ana a repair draw. She draws 54.

00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:15.000
Ana puts 54 in the last slot to restore her row.

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:19.000
All eight cards are in order. Ana wins.
